{"logId": "a2c2dadc-9cfd-4ac5-aee3-7e11d8ef89b3", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "第四章 录用", "block_bbox": [1210, 295, 1508, 345], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[1210.0, 295.0], [1508.0, 295.0], [1508.0, 345.0], [1210.0, 345.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一、录用原则", "block_bbox": [258, 426, 497, 469], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[258.0, 426.0], [497.0, 426.0], [497.0, 469.0], [258.0, 469.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 员工招聘将根据公司的需要进行。", "block_bbox": [338, 483, 919, 527], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[338.0, 483.0], [919.0, 483.0], [919.0, 527.0], [338.0, 527.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 公司采用相对公平、公正、公开的原则。", "block_bbox": [336, 538, 1030, 583], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 538.0], [1030.0, 538.0], [1030.0, 583.0], [336.0, 583.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 公司的招聘以面试方式为主。", "block_bbox": [336, 595, 846, 639], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 595.0], [846.0, 595.0], [846.0, 639.0], [336.0, 639.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二、录用条件", "block_bbox": [261, 651, 495, 695], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[261.0, 651.0], [495.0, 651.0], [495.0, 695.0], [261.0, 695.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 新聘员工一般实行试用期制度，试用期限二个月。", "block_bbox": [335, 707, 1173, 752], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 707.0], [1173.0, 707.0], [1173.0, 752.0], [335.0, 752.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 试用期满考核", "block_bbox": [337, 764, 612, 807], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 764.0], [612.0, 764.0], [612.0, 807.0], [337.0, 807.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "新聘人员试用期满前，由各部门主管进行考核，考核合格者正式录用。试用期内如发现不符合录用条件的，可随时解除劳动关系。", "block_bbox": [359, 819, 2447, 865], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[359.0, 819.0], [2447.0, 819.0], [2447.0, 865.0], [359.0, 865.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 以下情况均将被视为不符合录用条件：", "block_bbox": [337, 876, 992, 920], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 876.0], [992.0, 876.0], [992.0, 920.0], [337.0, 920.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑ 判处有期徒刑，尚在服刑者；", "block_bbox": [373, 933, 881, 976], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[373.0, 933.0], [881.0, 933.0], [881.0, 976.0], [373.0, 976.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "被剥夺公民权利者：", "block_bbox": [375, 990, 734, 1032], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[375.0, 990.0], [734.0, 990.0], [734.0, 1032.0], [375.0, 1032.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "通缉在案者：", "block_bbox": [375, 1046, 624, 1088], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[375.0, 1046.0], [624.0, 1046.0], [624.0, 1088.0], [375.0, 1088.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "经公司指定医院体检不合格者；", "block_bbox": [375, 1102, 916, 1145], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[375.0, 1102.0], [916.0, 1102.0], [916.0, 1145.0], [375.0, 1145.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "未满16周岁者：", "block_bbox": [376, 1158, 659, 1201], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[376.0, 1158.0], [659.0, 1158.0], [659.0, 1201.0], [376.0, 1201.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑有欺骗、隐瞒行为者；", "block_bbox": [376, 1214, 769, 1258], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[376.0, 1214.0], [769.0, 1214.0], [769.0, 1258.0], [376.0, 1258.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑ 患有精神病或传染病者；", "block_bbox": [376, 1271, 805, 1314], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[376.0, 1271.0], [805.0, 1271.0], [805.0, 1314.0], [376.0, 1314.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑ 酗酒、吸毒者：", "block_bbox": [376, 1328, 661, 1370], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[376.0, 1328.0], [661.0, 1328.0], [661.0, 1370.0], [376.0, 1370.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "不具备政府规定的就业手续者：", "block_bbox": [375, 1384, 914, 1426], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[375.0, 1384.0], [914.0, 1384.0], [914.0, 1426.0], [375.0, 1426.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑ 亏空、拖欠公款尚未清偿者；", "block_bbox": [377, 1440, 879, 1483], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[377.0, 1440.0], [879.0, 1440.0], [879.0, 1483.0], [377.0, 1483.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "工作能力不符合要求者。", "block_bbox": [376, 1496, 806, 1539], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[376.0, 1496.0], [806.0, 1496.0], [806.0, 1539.0], [376.0, 1539.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三、录用程序", "block_bbox": [263, 1552, 495, 1595], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[263.0, 1552.0], [495.0, 1552.0], [495.0, 1595.0], [263.0, 1595.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 各部门主管可以根据本部门发展或职位空缺情况，协同人力资源部进行招聘。", "block_bbox": [335, 1609, 1607, 1653], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 1609.0], [1607.0, 1609.0], [1607.0, 1653.0], [335.0, 1653.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 被录用的需在公司指定的医院进行体检。", "block_bbox": [334, 1665, 1026, 1708], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[334.0, 1665.0], [1026.0, 1665.0], [1026.0, 1708.0], [334.0, 1708.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 公司在岗员工应当进行年度体检，以保证公司的全面卫生质量。如员工患传染病，将被调任其他职位或在治疗期间暂停工作。", "block_bbox": [333, 1721, 2373, 1766], "block_id": 24, "block_order": 25, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[333.0, 1721.0], [2373.0, 1721.0], [2373.0, 1766.0], [333.0, 1766.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "18", "block_bbox": [188, 1829, 232, 1858], "block_id": 25, "block_order": null, "group_id": 25, "block_polygon_points": [[188.0, 1829.0], [231.0, 1829.0], [231.0, 1857.0], [188.0, 1857.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.859616756439209, "coordinate": [1210, 295, 1508, 345], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[1210.0, 295.0], [1508.0, 295.0], [1508.0, 345.0], [1210.0, 345.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8687949776649475, "coordinate": [258, 426, 497, 469], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[258.0, 426.0], [497.0, 426.0], [497.0, 469.0], [258.0, 469.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8540475368499756, "coordinate": [338, 483, 919, 527], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[338.0, 483.0], [919.0, 483.0], [919.0, 527.0], [338.0, 527.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8576783537864685, "coordinate": [336, 538, 1030, 583], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 538.0], [1030.0, 538.0], [1030.0, 583.0], [336.0, 583.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8196195960044861, "coordinate": [336, 595, 846, 639], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 595.0], [846.0, 595.0], [846.0, 639.0], [336.0, 639.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title"